# Determinism starts here. The generator's contract is byte-identical output for
# identical input (plan §4), so no file in this repository is allowed to change
# shape depending on who checked it out — `core.autocrlf` is overridden, not trusted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
gradlew text eol=lf

*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
